<p>In this guide, we&#x27;ve built a multi-step form using Laravel Volt, Folio, and Neon Postgres. We&#x27;ve covered form validation, data storage, and routing, demonstrating how these tools can be used together to create a dynamic and interactive form.</p>
<p>To further improve this project, consider adding features like:</p>
<ul>
<li>File uploads for resumes</li>
<li>Email notifications to applicants</li>
<li>An admin interface to review applications</li>
</ul>
<p>One thing to keep in mind is always to validate and sanitize user inputs, optimize your database queries, and thoroughly test your application before deploying to production.</p>
